# site/src/data/*.json ARE tracked, deliberately.
#
# They are generated by catalogue/build_db.py, and they used to be ignored
# on the reasoning that generated files do not belong in a repository. That
# broke the only deploy that mattered: the seller downloaded the repo as a
# zip, ran `npm run deploy`, and the build died on
# "Could not resolve ../data/business.json". A checkout has to build, and
# these two are 7 KB. Regenerate them with build_db.py; do not re-ignore.
